ESLint v9 flat config integration and documentation (REQ-ESLINT-COMPAT, User Experience, Documentation):
- eslint.config.js uses flat-config array and integrates plugin via `plugins: { ...(plugin.rules ? { traceability: plugin } : {}) }` for TS/JS files and sets appropriate language options and ignores.
- README.md includes installation (`npm install --save-dev eslint-plugin-traceability`), flat-config usage examples with `plugins: { traceability: {} }` and `traceability.configs.recommended`, and guidance to user-docs/eslint-9-setup-guide.md.
- user-docs/eslint-9-setup-guide.md provides detailed ESLint 9 flat-config examples and explicitly shows how to integrate `eslint-plugin-traceability` via `traceability.configs.recommended`.

